{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Konbini Simulator Demo Version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a preview of &quot;Konbini Simulator&quot; with this free demo version available on Steam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that this is a limited, trial version designed to give players a taste of the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes selected features and gameplay elements, allowing you to explore the core mechanics and enjoy a glimpse of the full experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final product may include additional content, improvements, and features not available in this demo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We encourage you to try the demo and look forward to your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Controls&gt; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD keys: Move left/right/up/down </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB key: Inventory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC key: Menu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E key: Pick up/throw items/talk to other characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space key: Jump </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left shift key: Dash </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Move camera </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click mouse: Place item </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click mouse: Return item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPurchase and Install Shelves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and install shelves from the inventory screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/extras/191ef4765256975e08113ca8d9c9d6d7.avif?t=1762422079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/extras/fb60c3b6d7040b1cb3e81602eb35708e.avif?t=1762422079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPurchase and Install Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and install items from the inventory screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/extras/c99c6928accfaa69e2ff593838591de7.avif?t=1762422079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/extras/83e65d581323bf4bb5c17a01eebad6e2.avif?t=1762422079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHire a Cashier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiring a cashier will automatically handle your cashiering needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/extras/d851d69ffab2a36c2626e6a7620e5a5f.avif?t=1762422079\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047210?t=1762422079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/778693cc9766af75526de645122fe8f77c45b3cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762422079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/e73ec3a2750b5fd7907c71721606a0299f87d0c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762422079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047210/e73ec3a2750b5fd7907c71721606a0299f87d0c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762422079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_de